\begin_inset Formula $2n-1$
\end_inset
, so it serves order 
\begin_inset Formula $2n$
\end_inset
. The moments have the form of Eq. 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:gauss"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
\end_inset
