\end_inset
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $t=0.05$
\end_inset
, and the error ratio between 
\begin_inset Formula $t=0.1$
\end_inset
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $t=0.05$
\end_inset
 for the random test:
